{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a fresh take on the cozy medieval tavern sim genre. Run your tavern and live your life with farming, fishing, cooking, decorating, brewing... while hidden systems reward harmony with nature. Explore ever-changing dungeons below to befriend monsters who can join your staff. Create a living, magical ecosystem unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/75b56b007addaed1ce0a716b4cf96c0f.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/75b56b007addaed1ce0a716b4cf96c0f.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/75b56b007addaed1ce0a716b4cf96c0f.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Tavern the way you like it with a great variety of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a84bb6a426bb481135b7e34c9605fd90.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a84bb6a426bb481135b7e34c9605fd90.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a84bb6a426bb481135b7e34c9605fd90.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your crops and take good care of them to improve your harvests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/574cb06043797fb194c56503cb34442d.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/574cb06043797fb194c56503cb34442d.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/574cb06043797fb194c56503cb34442d.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fresh products from your garden and farm to prepare delicious dishes and serve drinks to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/fd24e31b961072fba941a2f3100ca3da.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/fd24e31b961072fba941a2f3100ca3da.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/fd24e31b961072fba941a2f3100ca3da.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through mysterious dungeons in search of loot to sell in your shop and monsters to catch and befriend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735030?t=1758644414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735030?t=1758644414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/cca322173238eb902cdeda3561489232e4171a8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758644414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/cca322173238eb902cdeda3561489232e4171a8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758644414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a fresh take on the cozy medieval tavern sim genre. Run your tavern and live your life with farming, fishing, cooking, decorating, brewing... while hidden systems reward harmony with nature. Explore ever-changing dungeons below to befriend monsters who can join your staff. Create a living, magical ecosystem unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/75b56b007addaed1ce0a716b4cf96c0f.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/75b56b007addaed1ce0a716b4cf96c0f.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/75b56b007addaed1ce0a716b4cf96c0f.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Tavern the way you like it with a great variety of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a84bb6a426bb481135b7e34c9605fd90.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a84bb6a426bb481135b7e34c9605fd90.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a84bb6a426bb481135b7e34c9605fd90.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your crops and take good care of them to improve your harvests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/574cb06043797fb194c56503cb34442d.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/574cb06043797fb194c56503cb34442d.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/574cb06043797fb194c56503cb34442d.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the fresh products from your garden and farm to prepare delicious dishes and serve drinks to the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/fd24e31b961072fba941a2f3100ca3da.poster.avif?t=1758644414\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/fd24e31b961072fba941a2f3100ca3da.webm?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/fd24e31b961072fba941a2f3100ca3da.mp4?t=1758644414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through mysterious dungeons in search of loot to sell in your shop and monsters to catch and befriend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>","developers":["Null Moon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/5648416d3ebbeae62203b4637903fbac8fa1bdd1/header.jpg?t=1758644414","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735030/927613462/c500e0d446733e5971117396cb27ff864be9329b/1750430279/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749318226","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735030/927613462/c500e0d446733e5971117396cb27ff864be9329b/1750430279/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749318226","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735030/927613462/c500e0d446733e5971117396cb27ff864be9329b/1750430279/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749318226","id":257151275,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151275/movie480.mp4?t=1749318226","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151275/movie_max.mp4?t=1749318226"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151275/edd2b9b2823cead179dd10b9ebec6cda81522937/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749318226","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151275/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749318226","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151275/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749318226"}}],"name":"Evergreen Tavern","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":